		(property "Notes" "PIN NUMBERS AND SEVERAL PIN NAMES ARE NOT VERIFIED: analog.com was unreachable from the stage-1 environment (HTTP 503). Net-level intent: VIN -> INFET ideal diode (Q4) -> RSNSI (R_SNSI, CLP-CLN) -> VSYS (service loads); buck SW -> L1 -> RSNSB (R_SNSB, CSP-CSN) -> VBAT_SW; BATFET ideal diode (Q5) VBAT_SW -> VSYS when no input. 4 cells selected by CELLS1/CELLS0 straps (coding unverified: both pins have GND/INTVCC/VCC2P5 strap resistors, fit per datasheet). Variant -FAD = I2C-adjustable charge voltage, MPPT off [U default 3.6 V/cell]. Rebuild this symbol from the datasheet before layout."
			(at 187.96 55.88 0)
			(effects
